{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_javascript_pages_phase_4_objects_and_classes_06_class_02_static_and_accessors_static_members", "label": "static members", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/javascript/pages/phase-4-objects-and-classes/06-class/02-static-and-accessors.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "static puts a member on the class object itself, not on instances or the prototype. instance.staticThing is undefined because the instance chain never passes through Ctor."}, {"id": "docs_javascript_pages_phase_4_objects_and_classes_06_class_02_static_and_accessors_this_in_static_method", "label": "this in a static method", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/javascript/pages/phase-4-objects-and-classes/06-class/02-static-and-accessors.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "this is the class it was called on. new this(...) in a factory returns the subclass because extends links class objects."}, {"id": "docs_javascript_pages_phase_4_objects_and_classes_06_class_02_static_and_accessors_polymorphic_factory", "label": "Polymorphic static factory", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/javascript/pages/phase-4-objects-and-classes/06-class/02-static-and-accessors.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Use new this(...) not new Model(...) so User.create() builds a User. Statics inherit through the class-object chain."}, {"id": "docs_javascript_pages_phase_4_objects_and_classes_06_class_02_static_and_accessors_static_initialization_blocks", "label": "Static initialization blocks", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/javascript/pages/phase-4-objects-and-classes/06-class/02-static-and-accessors.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Run statements (loops, try/catch) and access private scope during class evaluation. Evaluated at the class statement, not first construction."}, {"id": "docs_javascript_pages_phase_4_objects_and_classes_06_class_02_static_and_accessors_class_accessors", "label": "Class getters and setters", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/javascript/pages/phase-4-objects-and-classes/06-class/02-static-and-accessors.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Accessors go on the prototype like methods. Pair a #private field with a public get/set. static get/set put the accessor on the class object."}, {"id": "docs_javascript_pages_phase_4_objects_and_classes_06_class_02_static_and_accessors_accessor_recursion_trap", "label": "Accessor infinite-recursion trap", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/javascript/pages/phase-4-objects-and-classes/06-class/02-static-and-accessors.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "get name() { return this.name; } calls itself until RangeError. Backing store must be a different name (#name)."}, {"id": "docs_javascript_pages_phase_4_objects_and_classes_06_class_02_static_and_accessors_static_evaluation_timing", "label": "Static fields evaluated at class evaluation", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/javascript/pages/phase-4-objects-and-classes/06-class/02-static-and-accessors.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "MDN: evaluated during class evaluation with this set to the class. A throwing block prevents the class existing; expensive work is paid at module load."}, {"id": "docs_javascript_pages_phase_4_objects_and_classes_06_class_02_static_and_accessors_page", "label": "06.2 \u00b7 Static members and accessors", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/javascript/p